      163.29,
      393.13,
      424.42,
      404.2
    ],
    "text": "THE NATIONAL THOROUGHFARES ACT, No. 40 OF 2008",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      417.13,
      539.87,
      440.2
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Highways and Investment Promotion under section 89(2)(c) of the ThoroughfaresAct, No. 40 of 2008 read with sections 13 and 14 of the aforesaid Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      453.13,
      526.18,
      512.2
    ],
    "text": "KABIR HASHIM,Minister of Highways andInvestment PromotionColombo,27th April, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      266.49,
      525.13,
      321.2,
      536.2
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      549.13,
      539.7,
      572.2
    ],
    "text": "1. These Regulations may be cited as the National Thoroughfares (Colombo-Katunayake User Fee National Highway)Regulations No. 1 of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      585.13,
      539.86,
      620.2
    ],
    "text": "2. These regulations shall apply to the \u201cColombo-Katunayake User Fee National Highway\u201d declared by Order madeunder section 11 of the National Thoroughfares Act, No. 40 of 2008 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1831/31 ofOctober 12, 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.13,
      633.13,
      540.02,
      668.2
    ],
    "text": "3.(1)There shall be levied from a driver of every vehicle being used on the aforesaid User Fee National Highway,a user fee in respect of the use of such User Fee National Highway by such driver, at such rates specified inPart A of the Schedule to these regulations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.73,
      761.39,
      88.89,
      770.25
    ],
    "text": "3 - PG 2444",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      90.33,
      527.87,
      140.01
    ],
    "text": "Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      31.824520111083984
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      72.25,
      544.97,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2015'04'27PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 27.04.20152A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.71,
      106.09,
      548.17,
      129.16
    ],
    "text": "(2)The user fee shall be charged in respect of the whole distance, or part thereof, of the User Fee NationalHighway.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.71,
      142.09,
      377.97,
      153.16
    ],
    "text": "(3)Different user fees may apply for different categories of vehicles.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      75.55,
      166.09,
      333.79,
      177.16
    ],
    "text": "(4)The user fee referred to in paragraph (1) shall be paid-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      75.55,
      190.09,
      170.12,
      201.16
    ],
    "text": "(a)manually by cash; or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.67,
      214.09,
      436.34,
      225.16
    ],
    "text": "(b)electronically through a device (hereinafter referred as \u201cE-tag\u201d) attached to the vehicle.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      79.39,
      250.09,
      548.18,
      309.16
    ],
    "text": "4. (1)An owner or driver of a vehicle who is desirous of making payments electronically (hereinafter referred as \u201cE-tag user\u201d) shall register with the Road Development Authority, established under the Road DevelopmentAuthority Act, No. 73 of 1981, (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Authority\u201d) and shall be required to open anElectronic Toll Collection System User Fee Account (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cETCS Account\u201d) at theCustomer Service Centre of the Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      93.31,
      322.09,
      548.16,
      345.16
    ],
    "text": "(2)Every application for registration as an E-tag user, shall be made to the Customer Service Centre of theAuthority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.71,
      358.09,
      548.16,
      393.16
    ],
    "text": "(3)Upon receipt of an application for registration the Authority may, on being satisfied with the informationprovided in the application including the information relating to the ETCS account, register such person as anE-tag user and issue him an E-tag for the purposes of these regulations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.71,
      406.09,
      548.18,
      429.16
    ],
    "text": "(4) Every E-tag user shall enter into an Electronic Toll Collection System User Fee customer agreement (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cETCS customer agreement\u201d) subject to the terms and conditions specified in such agreement.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      93.31,
      442.09,
      399.1,
      453.16
    ],
    "text": "(5) Every E-tag issued shall be fitted on to the windscreen of the vehicle.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      93.31,
      466.09,
      548.18,
      501.16
    ],
    "text": "(6)It shall be the duty of every E-tag user to maintain a sufficient credit balance in the ETCS Account at all timeswhen using an Electronic user fee collection lane (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cETC lane\u201d) enabling suchperson to make the payment of such user fee.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      93.31,
      514.09,
      548.14,
      537.16
    ],
    "text": "(7)In case of insufficient credit, the E-tag user may top-up the ETCS account and the processing time of suchtop-up shall be not less than one hour before the E-tag user may be able to use ETC lane.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.11,
      550.09,
      548.35,
      573.16
    ],
    "text": "(8) Every E-tag user shall ensure that the E-tag is in proper working order and shall inform the Authority of anydamage or loss to such E-tag.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      79.39,
      598.09,
      548.25,
      633.16
    ],
    "text": "5.(1)Where an E-tag user with sufficient credit to pay the user fee, enters the User Fee National Highway from aninterchange other than from a designated location, such E-tag user shall be permitted to proceed along theETC lane of such interchange.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      93.31,
      646.09,
      548.44,
      681.16
    ],
    "text": "(2)Where a vehicle fitted with an E-tag is being used on an ETC lane, the user fee shall be debited against theETCS Account automatically and the E-tag user may obtain a statement in relation to the usage of suchaccount from the Customer Care Centre of the Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.71,
      694.09,
      548.17,
      729.16
    ],
    "text": "(3)Where an E-tag user, does not have sufficient credit to pay the user fee, such E-tag user shall divert hisvehicle from the ETC lane to the manual user fee collection lane (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cMUC lane\u201d).The provisions of regulation 6 shall apply in relation to the payment of such fees.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.09,
      72.25,
      535.74,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2015'04'27PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 27.04.2015",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      528.33,
      72.25,
      540.33,
      83.32
    ],
    "text": "3A",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.13,
      109.21,
      539.93,
      144.28
    ],
    "text": "6.(1)Where a driver of a vehicle which is not fitted with an E-tag enters the User Fee National Highway from aninterchange other than from a designated location prior to being permitted to proceed along MUC lane, shall,obtain a ticket from the Teller on duty, manning the paying station at the gates of such interchange.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      157.21,
      539.85,
      180.28
    ],
    "text": "(2) The driver of a vehicle referred to in paragraph (1) of this regulation, when arriving at a paying station of aninterchange or a designated location for the purpose of exiting such User Fee National Highway shall-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      105.69,
      193.21,
      509.64,
      216.28
    ],
    "text": "(i)surrender the ticket obtained at the interchange through which he entered the User Fee NationalHighway, to the Teller at MUC lane ; or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      103.29,
      229.21,
      530.84,
      240.28
    ],
    "text": "(ii)inform the Teller at the designated location through which he entered the User Fee National Highway.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.05,
      248.41,
      539.89,
      283.48
    ],
    "text": "(3)For vehicles using MUC lane, the Teller shall inform the driver of the amount of the fee payable and accordinglythe driver shall pay such amount, prior to being permitted to pass through such interchange or designatedlocation, and the teller shall issue a receipt in respect of such payment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.13,
      291.61,
      539.89,
      326.68
    ],
    "text": "7.(1)A driver who has obtained a ticket referred to in Regulation 6 (1) shall be required to keep such ticket securelyin his possession until he reaches the paying station of the interchange or the designated location throughwhich he intends to exit such User Fee National Highway.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      87.45,
      339.61,
      229.58,
      350.68
    ],
    "text": "(2)Where the driver is unable to-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      119.85,
      358.81,
      224.75,
      369.88
    ],
    "text": "(a) surrender the ticket; or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      119.85,
      378.01,
      483.58,
      389.08
    ],
    "text": "(b) fails to identify the location through which he entered the User Fee National Highway,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      402.01,
      539.94,
      425.08
    ],
    "text": "the driver shall be deemed to have travelled the entire distance of the User Fee National Highway and shallaccordingly be charged for the entire distance of the User Fee National Highway.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.13,
      451.21,
      539.92,
      474.28
    ],
    "text": "8.(1)The Authority shall ensure that, for the purpose of implementation of the provisions of these regulations, asufficient number of gates are positioned at the required places along the User Fee National Highway.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      87.45,
      487.21,
      539.87,
      510.28
    ],
    "text": "(2)The gates so positioned along the User Fee National Highway shall be owned operated and maintained bythe Authority, and each gate shall be manned by a Teller.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      87.45,
      523.21,
      539.91,
      558.28
    ],
    "text": "(3)The Teller on the MUC lanes shall be responsible for the collection of the user fee at every gate referred to inparagraph (2), in such sum as is specified in Part A of the Schedule to these regulations from every driver usingsuch User Fee National Highway:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      571.21,
      539.89,
      594.28
    ],
    "text": "Provided that the provisions of these regulations shall not apply to a driver who is driving a vehicle of acategory specified in Part B of the Schedule to these regulations, which is exempt from such payment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      609.61,
      539.94,
      632.68
    ],
    "text": "9. The Teller shall at such times as are specified, hand over the day\u2019s collection of the fees to the officer authorized inthat behalf by the Authority and obtain a receipt in respect of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      640.81,
      539.93,
      663.88
    ],
    "text": "10. The money so collected as user fees shall be credited to the Fund of the Authority and be used for the purpose ofdeveloping and maintaining the User Fee National Highway to which these regulations apply.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      672.01,
      539.65,
      695.08
    ],
    "text": "11. The driver of a vehicle who contravenes the provisions of these regulations shall commit an offence and shall onconviction after summary trial by a Magistrate be liable in the case of-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      105.93,
      703.21,
      378.15,
      714.28
    ],
    "text": "(a) a first offence, to a fine not exceeding five thousand rupees; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      105.93,
      721.21,
      436.69,
      732.28
    ],
